# NOTE: test tokens ("tanyao-dev-token") are mock-only defaults for the
# in-repo fake agent; the REAL device token lives on-device at
# /data/local/tmp/.tanyao-token (0600) and in the operator's env only.
tests/tanyao_target  (compiled aarch64 binary; build from tanyao_target.c)
